medieval-ritual-soma2-book = While Life Remains
medieval-ritual-soma2-name = Last Aid
medieval-ritual-soma2-desc = Prepare one touch that stabilizes a living patient for 90 seconds.

medieval-ritual-soma3-book = House of Mercy
medieval-ritual-soma3-name = Field Hospital
medieval-ritual-soma3-desc = For five minutes, stabilize patients, restore blood and heal wounds and burns inside the circle.

medieval-ritual-soma4-book = The Inviolable Refuge
medieval-ritual-soma4-name = Dome of Mercy
medieval-ritual-soma4-desc = A two-minute hospital whose boundary blocks attacks both ways. People may pass.

medieval-ritual-terraharvest2-book = First Harvest
medieval-ritual-terraharvest2-name = Awaken the Crops
medieval-ritual-terraharvest2-desc = Immediately ripen up to four living crops.

medieval-ritual-terraharvest3-book = Roots Remember
medieval-ritual-terraharvest3-name = Restore the Garden
medieval-ritual-terraharvest3-desc = Restore and ripen up to twelve surviving planted crops.

medieval-ritual-terraharvest4-book = Endless Summer
medieval-ritual-terraharvest4-name = Great Harvest
medieval-ritual-terraharvest4-desc = Ripen up to twenty-four crops and grant two additional harvests, including single-harvest plants.

medieval-ritual-terrabeasts2-book = Language of the Quiet Forest
medieval-ritual-terrabeasts2-name = Beast Truce
medieval-ritual-terrabeasts2-desc = Nearby wild beasts stop attacking for three minutes. Harming a beast ends its truce.

medieval-ritual-terrabeasts3-book = Pact with the Wild Heart
medieval-ritual-terrabeasts3-name = Beast Covenant
medieval-ritual-terrabeasts3-desc = Bind a beast brought into the circle as a chosen participant's permanent companion.

medieval-ritual-terrabeasts4-book = Oath of the Pack
medieval-ritual-terrabeasts4-name = Command the Pack
medieval-ritual-terrabeasts4-desc = Bind up to three real monsters to a chosen participant.

medieval-ritual-magnusantimagic2-book = The Limits of Sorcery
medieval-ritual-magnusantimagic2-name = Circle of Prohibition
medieval-ritual-magnusantimagic2-desc = For one minute, prevent spells from starting and completing inside the area.

medieval-ritual-magnusantimagic3-book = The Boundary of Silent Mana
medieval-ritual-magnusantimagic3-name = Antimagic Dome
medieval-ritual-magnusantimagic3-desc = For two minutes, suppress casting, magical projectiles and teleportation across the boundary.

medieval-ritual-magnusantimagic4-book = Walking in the Void
medieval-ritual-magnusantimagic4-name = Bearer of Antimagic
medieval-ritual-magnusantimagic4-desc = A complete antimagic zone follows a chosen participant for 75 seconds.

medieval-ritual-magnuscreation2-book = First Spark
medieval-ritual-magnuscreation2-name = Birth of Magic
medieval-ritual-magnuscreation2-desc = Create a single wonder. Dedicate suitable offerings to choose its manifestation.

medieval-ritual-magnuscreation3-book = A Place of Wonders
medieval-ritual-magnuscreation3-name = Place of Wonders
medieval-ritual-magnuscreation3-desc = Saturate an area with the magical phenomenon selected by the offerings.

medieval-ritual-magnuscreation4-book = On the Birth of Sources
medieval-ritual-magnuscreation4-name = Source of Magic
medieval-ritual-magnuscreation4-desc = Create a lasting source of compatible magical phenomena selected by offerings.

medieval-ritual-kreza2-book = Unlinked Chains
medieval-ritual-kreza2-name = Swift Release
medieval-ritual-kreza2-desc = Prepare a charge that removes restraints in one second, including your own.

medieval-ritual-kreza3-book = The Right to Return
medieval-ritual-kreza3-name = Return to the Circle
medieval-ritual-kreza3-desc = Prepare a three-second return to this circle with the person you are pulling.

medieval-ritual-kreza4-book = The Open Road
medieval-ritual-kreza4-name = Gates of Kreza
medieval-ritual-kreza4-desc = Connect two owned circles with permanent gates. Their creator closes them manually.

medieval-ritual-valtor2-book = Iron Breath
medieval-ritual-valtor2-name = Overcome Fatigue
medieval-ritual-valtor2-desc = Prepare 45 seconds without exhaustion consequences. Accumulated fatigue remains.

medieval-ritual-valtor3-book = Not One Step Back
medieval-ritual-valtor3-name = Hold Consciousness
medieval-ritual-valtor3-desc = Prepare one minute of activity despite critical injuries. Lethal damage still kills.

medieval-ritual-valtor4-book = The Last Oath
medieval-ritual-valtor4-name = Death Deferred
medieval-ritual-valtor4-desc = A living human sacrifice grants up to four participants one 30-second reprieve from death.

medieval-ritual-zaygotheft2-book = The Closed Pocket
medieval-ritual-zaygotheft2-name = Hand of Zaygo
medieval-ritual-zaygotheft2-desc = Prepare a silent theft of a chosen small item from a closed bag.

medieval-ritual-zaygoidentity3-book = Another Life
medieval-ritual-zaygoidentity3-name = Identity Theft
medieval-ritual-zaygoidentity3-desc = A wax impression copies appearance, voice, clothing and papers without copying their functions.

medieval-ritual-zaygoplace4-book = What Was Never Here
medieval-ritual-zaygoplace4-name = Theft of Place
medieval-ritual-zaygoplace4-desc = The source area follows the thief's coin. Offerings choose the spoils; obstacles move back to the source.


